WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.252
Assistance requested
by army and municipal police!

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.921
Someone's attacking an army convoy!

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:10.176
They've stolen an IFV and are now fleeing
towards the capital on the Aqua Line!

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:12.470
The royal family has declared martial law!

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:15.140
-We're to obey Gen. Bern's instructions!
-What's this?

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:16.933
Is this a revolution?

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.893
Everyone, get there ASAP!

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:21.104
-Mario! Take command on scene!
-Roger!

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.982
Brandon, you're our liaison
with the local cops!

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.025
-Roger!
-Boris!

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:28.486
Could you handle the army?
Please oversee our unit placement!

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:31.156
-Wait, you want me to do it?
-Yes, you!

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:32.741
All right, fine.

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:34.117
-Keith.
-What?

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:37.203
There's an emergency.
I'd like your assistance.

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:02.729
You flies are getting on my nerves!

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:06.649
This looks like trouble.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.735
Lily! We're gonna get behind it!

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:11.613
-Can you get ahead of or next to it?
-Uh...

00:01:11.696 --> 00:01:12.947
Cut through the park!

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.699
Rodger Dodger!

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.035
W-Wait, Lily! Don't--

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:22.916
I didn't mean it literally!
Use the road! The road!

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:24.626
Target acquired!

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:26.628
Lily!

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:28.713
Here we come!

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:44.104
-Lily! It's firing at us!
-Sorry! Falling back!

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:46.815
Lily!

00:01:50.527 --> 00:01:53.738
We can't get near it with this car!
You get ahead of it!

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:56.282
Where is he? Come on out!

00:01:56.699 --> 00:02:02.288
Show yourself, you monster!

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:14.884
Die!

00:02:15.176 --> 00:02:18.054
I'll crush you all!

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:21.641
This guy is nuts.
I have no idea what his objective is!

00:02:21.724 --> 00:02:23.518
We're not letting him get away!

00:02:25.436 --> 00:02:28.439
Julian, I hate to interrupt
while you're having fun,

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:30.984
but it's time to lose them.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:39.868
Hey, Mario!

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:41.077
Watch the sensors!

00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:45.456
A smoke screen and an APS?

00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:48.168
This isn't an ordinary IFV?

00:02:48.251 --> 00:02:50.253
It probably contains
carbon fiber particles.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:54.174
Radar waves are being jammed.
Unable to monitor situation.

00:02:54.257 --> 00:02:56.217
-Anything on thermal?
-Not a thing.

00:02:57.802 --> 00:03:01.472
Seal off all areas immediately.
Just get that thing contained.

00:03:03.266 --> 00:03:04.184
This is Alpha!

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:07.729
Eric! Where'd the IFV go?
Requesting instructions!

